<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Aracruz raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Aracruz raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co said it raised its rating on Aracruz Celulose SA to neutral from underperform, &quot;to reflect our belief that Aracruz is fairly valued at the current time.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Oppenheimer said it cut its 1996 earnings per share forecast to $0.51 from $0.56 and its 1997 EPS view to $0.08 from $0.26 due to lower production estimates and lowered financial income gains.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/8 at 8-1/4 on the NYSE.</p>
</text>
